Package: inferplotR
Type: Package
Title: Black-and-White Figures with Inference Layers for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", , "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Extends 'ggplot2' with a black-and-white figure theme for papers
    following the APA style rules and for slides, scales that replace color
    with line types, point shapes and hatch patterns, direct labels and size
    presets. Its inference layers run explicitly named procedures through
    'infercalcR', label them with display strings from 'infereportR' and keep
    the full results retrievable from the figure. A character mode redraws
    plots on a monospaced text grid in the style of 1980s home computers.
