Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), infercalcR (>= 0.1.0), infereportR (>= 0.1.0),
    grid, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, ragg, systemfonts, testthat (>= 3.1.7), withr
